abstract: "A static rebuild of the Carrying Capacity Dashboard of Lane, Dawes and Grace (2014, 2015) and Lane (2017). Versioned releases (2011 and 2025 data; published, corrected and improved methods), the data pipeline, the evaluator, and the results files from which the papers' tables are generated. Pre-freeze snapshot: later versions follow the method freeze."
